15. System Testing

The complete application is tested as one system.

Complete test scenario

1. Open LegalEase.


2. Select a document type.


3. Enter the required information.


4. Submit the form.


5. Generate the AI draft.


6. View the generated document.


7. Edit the document.


8. Regenerate if necessary.


9. Download the document.


10. Open the downloaded file.



The complete process should work without unexpected errors.


---

16. User Interface Testing

The user interface is tested for:

Button functionality

Navigation

Text readability

Form alignment

Responsive design

Mobile compatibility

Desktop compatibility

Error messages

Loading indicators


The interface should remain simple enough for users who have limited technical knowledge.


---

17. Performance Testing

Performance testing checks how quickly the system responds.

The following are measured:

Page loading time

Form submission time

AI response time

Document-generation time

Download time


The application should provide a loading indicator during longer AI operations so users understand that processing is taking place.


---

18. Security Testing

Security testing focuses on protecting user information and application credentials.

Tests include:

Checking that API keys are not exposed in frontend code.

Testing input validation.

Checking unauthorized access.

Checking file access controls where applicable.

Ensuring sensitive information is not unnecessarily stored.

Checking secure communication during deployment.


The .env file containing API credentials should not be uploaded to GitHub.


---

19. Error Handling Testing

The system is intentionally tested with incorrect conditions.

AI API unavailable

Expected:

> Unable to generate the document. Please try again later.



Missing information

Expected:

> Please complete all required fields.



Network failure

Expected:

> Connection error. Please check your internet connection.



Document-generation failure

Expected:

> Unable to create the document. Please try again.



These messages should be clear and understandable.


---

