23. Bug Identification and Fixing

During testing, any problems found are recorded.

Example bug report

Bug	Cause	Solution

Generate button not working	Backend route error	Corrected route
PDF formatting incorrect	Template issue	Updated PDF formatting
Missing-field error not displayed	Validation problem	Added validation
AI output contains unwanted text	Prompt issue	Improved prompt
