After fixing each bug, the relevant test is repeated.


---

24. Regression Testing

After fixing bugs, previously working features are tested again.

For example:

Fix AI Generation
       ↓
Test AI Generation
       ↓
Retest Preview
       ↓
Retest Editing
       ↓
Retest Download

This ensures that a new change has not broken an existing feature.


