27. Conclusion

The Project Testing Phase ensures that LegalEase: AI-Powered Legal Document Generator is functional, reliable, user-friendly, and ready for demonstration.

Testing covers the complete workflow:

User Input → Validation → AI Processing → Draft Generation → Preview → Editing → Download

After identifying and fixing bugs, the final application can proceed to the Project Documentation Phase, followed by the Project Demonstration Phase.
